# Surfaces an agent must not be able to change without a human on the diff.
#
# The threat is specific: every required check lives in .github/workflows, so
# an agent with write access there can weaken the gate that reviews it, and no
# gate objects because the gate is what changed. Same argument for tools/,
# which holds the gate's own implementation, and .claude/, whose hooks run with
# this repo's credentials. Reasoning: docs/process/PROCESS.md stage 24.
#
# This file is inert on its own. It has teeth only once branch protection on
# main requires review from Code Owners. Set that once; it is the other half.

/.github/   @zacgoodwin
/tools/     @zacgoodwin
/.claude/   @zacgoodwin
